#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Manage compute and data across your Qiskit pattern with Qiskit Serverless."
msgstr ""
"Gestiona el cómputo y los datos en tu patrón Qiskit con Qiskit Serverless."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Qiskit Serverless compute and data resources"
msgstr "Gestionar recursos de cómputo y datos de Qiskit Serverless"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-manage-resources.ipynb\" "
